{"id":"666671","name":"炒红薯叶","author":"金凤栖梧","authorId":"8221247","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/666671/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红薯叶","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"干辣椒","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"花盆中种的。","img":"images/666671/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"剪到盆里，加点盐用水冲洗干净。","img":"images/666671/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"控去水加盐腌15分钟。","img":"images/666671/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再次冲水洗去盐，捞出。蒜切片，干辣椒切段。","img":"images/666671/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中油热炒香葱片和辣椒。","img":"images/666671/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入红薯叶大火翻炒。","img":"images/666671/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加盐，味精炒匀。","img":"images/666671/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/666671/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/666671/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}